
---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import HeroWithPicture from "../components/HeroWithPicture.astro";
import FormMain from "../components/FormMain.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---

<BaseLayout>
  <HeroWithPicture
    heroHeading="Privacy Policy"
    heroText="We are committed to protecting your personal information and your right to privacy. If you have any questions about this policy, please contact us."
    heroImage="/images/privacy.png"
    heroImageAlt="Privacy policy image"
  />
  <p>

    Northjay Solutions Inc. respects your privacy. When you submit your information through this form, we may collect details such as your name, email address, phone number, business name,
     and any other information you choose to provide. 
    We use this information to respond to your inquiry, contact you about your request, provide information about our services, and follow up on potential business opportunities. 
    We do not sell your personal information. We may use trusted service providers, such as CRM, email, website, or advertising platforms, to help us manage and respond to inquiries, 
    and these providers may process information on our behalf. We retain personal information only as long as reasonably necessary for the purposes described above or as required by law. 
    You may request access to, correction of, or deletion of your personal information by contacting Northjay Solutions Inc via the contact form below.
  </p>
  <FormMain />
  <Footer/>
</BaseLayout>